    <p><strong>Worked example.</strong> Arjun is 33, spending ₹90,000 a month today, and wants to retire at 48. At 6.5% inflation over 15 years, his monthly spend becomes approximately ₹2.27 lakh. Annual expenses: ₹27.2 lakh. Corpus needed at 30x: approximately ₹8.17 crore. Plus healthcare buffer: ₹20 lakh. <strong>Total FIRE target: ₹8.37 crore.</strong></p>

